<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets call warrants on HSBC.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets call warrants on HSBC.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Friday it has launched 80 million American style call warrants on shares of HSBC Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>Ten warrant control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$231.00     PREMIUM	    15.15 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$2.233	GEARING	    9.9x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   31.MAR.98     MIN EXER LOT     4,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$220.00     SETTLEMENT DATE  03.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG     LISTING DATE     04.JUN.97</p>
<p> NOTE		   PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
